# Prettier resolves --ignore-path patterns relative to THIS file's directory
# (nodejs/), not the working directory -- so every repo-root path needs the
# ../ prefix. Prettier is invoked from nodejs/ and pointed at `..`; see
# nodejs/package.json and forge.toml.
#
# The heavy build dirs must stay listed: without them prettier walks ~4 GB of
# flutter/build + rust-sender/target and effectively hangs.
node_modules
dist
pnpm-lock.yaml
../node_modules
../.pnpm-store
../flutter/build
../flutter/.dart_tool
../flutter/macos/Flutter/ephemeral
../flutter/third_party
../rust-sender/target
../received
../test_data
../pnpm-lock.yaml
../CHANGELOG.md
